# Copy to .dev.vars for local development. Never commit .dev.vars.
#
# A personal access token with no scopes is enough for public data.
# The GitHub GraphQL API refuses every request without one.
GITHUB_TOKEN=""

# Logins never shown on a board, comma separated and case insensitive.
# Set in production with `wrangler secret put EXCLUDED_LOGINS`.
EXCLUDED_LOGINS=""
